### Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks

### Add a new task
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Buy milk"
}

### Add another task
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Walk the dog"
}

### Delete task with id = 1
DELETE http://localhost:8080/tasks/1

### Get all tasks again
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks
